Tiered Storage: Store data on different media based on access frequency.

Hot Data: Frequently accessed. NVMe SSD
Warm Data: Sometimes accessed. SSD
Cold Data: Rarely used. HDD/Object Storage

Goal: Reduce storage cost without sacrificing performance.

Example:
Netflix: Recent content → Fast tier, Older content → Cheaper tier

NetApp: FabricPool automatically tiers cold data to object storage.